<title>USA: North American to buy back 15.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>North American to buy back 15.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>North American Resorts Inc said on Monday it has agreed to buy back 15.5 million common-stock shares, which will then be retired.</p>
<p>Terms of the buy-back were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The company also said it has begun preliminary negotiations with a local television and film production company about possibly buying controlling interest in North American.</p>
<p>North American shares were trading at 0.054 early Monday, up 0.004 on the day.</p>
